{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01160","headline":"相和歌辞 猛虎行 · 僧齐己","name":"相和歌辞 猛虎行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"磨尔牙，错尔爪，狐莫威，兔莫狡，饮来吞噬取肠饱。\n横行不怕日月明，皇天产尔爲生狞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}